   6:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          functionalities of the FLASH extension peripheral:
   8:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *           + Extended programming operations functions
   9:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *
