 622:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @note   When the memory read protection level is selected (RDP level = 1),
 623:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         it is not possible to program or erase the flash sector i if CortexM4
