 629:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *            @arg WRPSector: A value between OB_WRP_SECTOR_0 and OB_WRP_SECTOR_23
