 961:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @brief  Erase the specified FLASH memory sector
 962:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @param  Sector FLASH sector to erase
 963:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         The value of this parameter depend on device used within the same series
 964:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @param  VoltageRange The device voltage range which defines the erase parallelism.
 965:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 966:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *            @arg FLASH_VOLTAGE_RANGE_1: when the device voltage range is 1.8V to 2.1V,
 967:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *                                  the operation will be done by byte (8-bit)
 968:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *            @arg FLASH_VOLTAGE_RANGE_2: when the device voltage range is 2.1V to 2.7V,
 969:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *                                  the operation will be done by half word (16-bit)
 970:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *            @arg FLASH_VOLTAGE_RANGE_3: when the device voltage range is 2.7V to 3.6V,
 971:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *                                  the operation will be done by word (32-bit)
 972:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *            @arg FLASH_VOLTAGE_RANGE_4: when the device voltage range is 2.7V to 3.6V + External
 973:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *                                  the operation will be done by double word (64-bit)
